(7719843, 1269933, 124815, '<td valign="top">This image made me think of a recent article on The Art Review<a href="https://artreview.com/what-does-it-mean-to-paint-like-an-artist/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paint like an artist</a> <br/>It is about putting the brush on canvas versus a "robotic" way of imitating it. Surely a controversial subject nowadays.<br/>A lot of people probably react to this image saying either nice, beautiful color, happy image and the like. But, is it ART?<br/>It surely is not a photograph either</td>', 'This image made me think of a recent article on The Art Reviewpaint like an artist It is about putting the brush on canvas versus a "robotic" way of imitating it. Surely a controversial subject nowadays.A lot of people probably react to this image saying either nice, beautiful color, happy image and the like. But, is it ART?It surely is not a photograph either', '2022-05-06 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
